1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
[TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS]

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
(sighs) The train to the coast
is late again.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
- [gasps] Look at the snow!
- CONDUCTOR: Tickets, please.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,000
♪ ♪

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
- Is the bakery open?
- (laughs)

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Baker: We open at six.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,000
<i>(whispering) The bread is still warm.</i>

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,000
MAN 2: Two loaves, please.

9
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,000
♪ Rain on the window ♪

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Note: the last train leaves at 11:40.

11
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,000
<i>[thunder rumbling]</i>
(dog barking)

12
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,000
Fish &amp; chips {chuckles} for two.

13
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,000
- DR. O'NEIL: Sit down, please.
- [chair creaks]

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,000
- # The wheels go round #
- It stopped raining. (birds chirping)
